+      <t>This document describes the experimental multicast dispatch profile implemented in Robotweax SRT 0.3.2. One sender transmits shared DATA over IP multicast while maintaining per-receiver unicast control and repair sessions. This initial editorial draft records the wire representation and identifies unresolved protocol and deployment requirements.</t>
